Package: dbgsom
Title: Directed Batch Growing Self-Organizing Map
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("DBGSOM", "Authors", email = "dbgsom@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: R implementation of the Directed Batch Growing Self-Organizing Map
    (DBGSOM) algorithm based on Vasighi & Amini (2017). Features dynamic hexagonal
    grid growth, NA-aware training, Vesanto two-level clustering, and pooled
    cross-sectional data preprocessing.
